{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本Suica交通卡新任形象角色「紫色兔子」近日公佈後，在網絡引發熱議。這隻由插畫家世户宏明設計的兔子以超過86萬票贏得民眾票選，接替陪伴用户25年的企鵝成為新一代代言人。然而新設計亮相不到一小時，社交平台上便因其紫色外觀與直勾勾的眼神，被網民冠以「毒兔子」（毒ウサギ）的戲謔稱號，相關詞條迅速登上趨勢榜。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/funny/1587056.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.569720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:18:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_hash":"ab7bffc2ca0f9b685aeea603ee0912ea18f0542f245b909482eb59707b56aafa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}